            "review_text": "Traveler of the Wild\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam66 contributions\n0\nExcellent beer selection, wonderful staff. Watch those heads:)))\nAug 2019\nAs usual, an excellent outing from this District 1 craft beer pub. A limited but delicious food menu but the king is certainly the craft beers and extraordinary bottle selection (as well as a wide range of drafts). One tiny area to improve is the size of the heads on their draft beers. It's a little inconsistent. Depending on who pours the beer it can be reasonable (head should be maximum 5% of the overall glass) or a little too big (approaching 15% of the total liquid in one case). I think this needs to be looked at. When people are paying VN160K a pint it need to be a full pour everytime. Anyway, still HIGHLY RECOMMENDED:)))))\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 25, 2019",
